{"title":"Sherpa Throw Blankets","description":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/photo-blankets\"\u003eAll Photo Blankets\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/polar-fleece-photo-blankets\"\u003ePolar Fleece\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/plush-fleece-photo-blankets\"\u003ePlush Fleece\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/hd-woven-photo-blankets\"\u003eHD Woven\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/jacquard-woven-photo-blankets\"\u003eJacquard Woven\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/sherpa-throw-blankets\"\u003eSherpa\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/products\/water-repellent-outdoor-picnic-blanket-50x-59\"\u003ePicnic Blankets\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/themed-designer-blankets\"\u003eThemed Designers\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003ci\u003eFront\u003c\/i\u003e, Silken Faux Micro Mink (100% Polyester) \u003ci\u003eBack\u003c\/i\u003e, Lusciously Soft Faux Sheepskin (100% Polyester)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 business days.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Indescribable softness.","products":[{"product_id":"60-x-50-heavy-weight-photo-collage-sherpa-throw-blanket","title":"50\" x 60\" Heavy Weight Quick Collage Sherpa Throw Blanket -10 Image Template","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet a stunning soft blanket that combines quality and comfort with the Heavy Weight Sherpa Lined Sublimated Throw. The top side features silken faux micro mink and the inside is a lusciously soft faux sheepskin Sherpa layer. The whip stitch border gives the blanket a rustic flair. It's made using 100% microfiber polyester fabric. This option allows for you to quickly and easily set up a 10 image collage using our template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50\" x 60\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003eFront\u003c\/i\u003e, Silken Faux Micro Mink (100% Polyester)\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003eBack\u003c\/i\u003e, Lusciously Soft Faux Sheepskin (100% Polyester)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eShips out\u003c\/em\u003e in 3 to 5 business days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42272430339,"sku":"50x60SHRPA-CLG","price":59.36,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-50-x-60-heavy-weight-photo-quick-collage-sherpa-throw-blanket-1.jpg?v=1501186883"},{"product_id":"turn-your-childs-drawing-into-a-60-x-50-heavy-weight-sherpa-throw-blanket","title":"Turn Your Child's Drawing into a 60\" x 50\" Heavy Weight Sherpa Throw Blanket","description":"\u003cp\u003ePersonalThrows introduces a new way to celebrate your child's imagination and creativity! Simply follow the steps:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT-KidsDrawing-50x60SHRPA.pdf?6804207295852083756\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #255798;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eDownload the template for this product\u003c\/a\u003e and have your child color it in.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScan it and upload it with your order, or mail it to us!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGet a customized gift your child will cherish for years to come.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT-KidsDrawing-50x60SHRPA.pdf?6804207295852083756\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-weight: 800; color: #255798;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eClick Here to Download the Template Here\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eScan requirements:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFile type:\u003c\/strong\u003e JPG, PDF or TIF.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eResolution:\u003c\/strong\u003e 300 DPI or higher.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003csub\u003e\u003cem\u003eWe do not accept camera phone photos of the templates at this time. Please do not send them.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/sub\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50\" x 60\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003eFront\u003c\/i\u003e, Silken Faux Micro Mink (100% Polyester)\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003eBack\u003c\/i\u003e, Lusciously Soft Faux Sheepskin 